pe="round-rect"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226, 232, 240, 1)" width="1"/><content fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)"/></shape><shape width="220" height="16" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="387" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(217, 119, 6, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>03 · RIBOMIMO ANCHORING</p></content></shape><shape width="836" height="34" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="408" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="9.4" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="true"><p>TB-MSE 2.186608221 → 2.158079586; mean r remains -0.001007566. Calibration alone does not rescue error or ranking.</p></content></shape><shape width="864" height="30" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="466" presetHandlers="6" type="round-rect"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(254, 243, 199, 1)"/></fill><content fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)"/></shape><shape width="836" height="21" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="470" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="9.4" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(217, 119, 6, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Component diagnosis is complete for the frozen arms; none is relabeled as a new result after inspecting the target.</p></content></shape><shape width="780" height="13" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="512" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="8.2" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100, 116, 139, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Source: result d3182b89eb27 · 3 seeds · primary and auxiliary arms</p></content></shape><shape width="62" height="15" topLeftX="850" topLeftY="510" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="10" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>178</p></content></shape></data><note><content><p>Position centering yields only a very small correlation increase and does not beat constant error.</p><p>The alternative frozen local penalty still produces high error and near-zero correlation in both sensitivity seeds.</p><p>Anchoring RiboMIMO changes calibration but does not make its error competitive or alter within-transcript correlation.</p></content></note></slide>
